    "notes": "This forces Steam to use Proton Experimental for BioShock Infinite (app 8870) instead of the buggy native Linux binary. The key was that checking the box in Steam's Properties UI wasn't saving the change, so I had to write it directly to the config file.\nI added the Proton compatibility mapping directly to Steam's config file at:\n\n~/.steam/debian-installation/userdata/1212961142/config/localconfig.vdf\n\nSpecifically, I added this section:\n\n\"CompatToolMapping\"\n{\n    \"8870\"\n    {\n        \"name\"      \"proton_experimental\"\n        \"config\"    \"\"\n        \"priority\"  \"75\"\n    }\n}\n",
